{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_048rei_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_048rei_8000_situation", "source_sha256": "f9587769ca7c5381105e2529737af108ee8390e9c4cf2c28d9588783ba22a012", "ja": "グラビア撮影のお仕事　開始前", "zh": "写真拍摄工作　开始前", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_048rei_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_048rei_8000_place", "source_sha256": "aca1eac689f3f35e8a0c948ad36c91eacb83d3112684768c09eedf8e0d27f15c", "ja": "バー", "zh": "酒吧", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_048rei_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_048rei_8001_p", "source_sha256": "cd96ba07711d435e5968909785a35dc384c2b506e68b7f9fff3799e2cb021f81", "ja": "（アイドル雑誌『ViDaVo!』のグラビア撮影で、\n麗花のテーマは『バーテンダー』だ）", "zh": "（这是偶像杂志《ViDaVo!》的写真拍摄，丽花的主题是“调酒师”）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_048rei_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_048rei_8002_048rei", "source_sha256": "9f205d51610a219c4570538fc012a68267126f297b1654d0c3559843322e434d", "ja": "うーん……。\nなにを入れようかな～？", "zh": "嗯……该放点什么好呢～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_048rei_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_048rei_8003_p", "source_sha256": "fccbbd310d57777cdeff3c97121350a5938f94fcdb7384edfeb7185d9bf5b8a6", "ja": "麗花、お疲れさま。\n悩んでるみたいだけど、どうかした？", "zh": "丽花，辛苦了。看起来你在烦恼，怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_048rei_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_048rei_8004_048rei", "source_sha256": "07e5f6038ec3cb213ed60dee25e935e8eeccb41af7622a1ffe01affc859205c5", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}さん！　撮影のために\nオリジナルカクテルを作ってたんですけど……。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生！我正在为拍摄制作原创鸡尾酒……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_048rei_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_048rei_8005_048rei", "source_sha256": "6739f674093ad939ba836d26cbd8bee9290ec00d076d838cb15dc3dbd100ee8e", "ja": "もう少しワクワクするような味にしたいんです。\nなにを入れたらいいと思いますか？", "zh": "我想调出更让人期待的味道。\n您觉得加入什么好呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_048rei_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_048rei_8006", "source_sha256": "6447adf52df87ce62e03762f9e9f67e2ce388c3016a4bb5c1f1e34bf48ce323f", "ja": "シナモン", "zh": "肉桂", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_048rei_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_048rei_8007", "source_sha256": "5e7f241dae7fbf46f312bfd0998903b3e7470907b4f8c0783b3400783d102b99", "ja": "さくらんぼ", "zh": "樱桃", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_048rei_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_048rei_8008", "source_sha256": "1b58d33d41742b6d740de890bee05c8ed2065bf0811e193cb402eaa6d28e06f5", "ja": "心意気", "zh": "气魄", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_048rei_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_048rei_8100_p", "source_sha256": "25b272cdeb0dd6075fe3f5f07c51987288dbe88f8c29df604f6e301dc1a9eac7", "ja": "シナモンを入れてみるのはどうかな？　カクテルに\n隠し味でスパイスを入れることもあるみたいだし。", "zh": "要不要试着在鸡尾酒里加点肉桂？听说有时也会加些香料作为秘密配方。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_048rei_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_048rei_8101_048rei", "source_sha256": "3c234b91e598c4da4548818a404979c06b76c7396480d3ed69c64bc897bbe28d", "ja": "そうなんですね。シナモンか～……うんうん！\nまだ入れてないのに、とってもワクワクしてきました！", "zh": "原来是这样啊。肉桂吗——……嗯嗯！\n明明还没加进去，我却已经开始期待起来了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_048rei_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_048rei_8102_048rei", "source_sha256": "ae2ee8a80298543c035bbd794d443c6b055b084be343607bbdcb94668395a680", "ja": "じゃあ、でき上がったカクテルを飲んだら……ふふ♪\nアドバイスありがとうございます！", "zh": "那么，喝下调好的鸡尾酒后……呵呵♪\n谢谢你的建议！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_048rei_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_048rei_8200_p", "source_sha256": "8c7c79ccd8640ce41a01f21ce00d4be1ce7da1be14a30aaa1d6e75f4a014be15", "ja": "さくらんぼはどうかな？　甘さもだけど\n果実の食感もワクワクする演出のひとつだと思うんだ。", "zh": "樱桃怎么样？除了甜味之外，\n果肉的口感也应该是让人感到期待的演出之一。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_048rei_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_048rei_8201_048rei", "source_sha256": "6efffb0751843cc204c24aa80e5303eeb370100d308e0d282858343deaa7c619", "ja": "なるほどなるほど～、普通でいいかもしれませんね！\n私の考えたオリジナルカクテルにも合いそうです。", "zh": "原来如此原来如此～，普通一点也许就不错呢！\n感觉也很适合我构思的原创鸡尾酒。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_048rei_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_048rei_8202_048rei", "source_sha256": "4b248de12cbdd11dc6757064e99da1bd55bbbb153826794a28002225e6119c6b", "ja": "それじゃあ、ちょっと作ってみますね。\n普通の人代表として、味見役、お願いしまーす♪", "zh": "那么，我就稍微做一下吧。\n作为普通人的代表，试喝员就拜托你啦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_048rei_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_048rei_8300_p", "source_sha256": "fcec70f653949844b295a333adbdb40473271a1f47d54e1079b5ad7fbe8586f0", "ja": "麗花の心意気、なんてどうかな？\n大事なのは『作り手の思い』だと思うんだ。", "zh": "丽花的心意，怎么样？\n我觉得重要的是『制作者的心意』。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_048rei_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_048rei_8301_048rei", "source_sha256": "b9df5b4b275958840e6935acbb62600d7e45d6a68023144e11c8c851e4707a47", "ja": "ふむふむ、たしかにそうですね！\nじゃあこのカクテルに、私の心意気を入れてみます！", "zh": "嗯嗯，确实如此！那我就试着把我的心意加入这杯鸡尾酒吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_048rei_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_048rei_8302_048rei", "source_sha256": "24fe53234ec270abd48b0dc267341fa34611a9b9fb37ad7cb65cf5d448cafc0f", "ja": "こーこーろーいーきー……えいっ！\n……うーん。なんか、あんまりワクワクしませんね～。", "zh": "心——意——气——……嘿！\n……嗯——总觉得，好像没那么让人兴奋呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
